# 5. Line Height

Consistent line spacing should be applied throughout the interface.

| Element    | Line Height |
| ---------- | ----------: |
| Body Text  |     1.5–1.6 |
| H1         |     1.1–1.2 |
| H2         |     1.2–1.3 |
| H3         |     1.2–1.4 |
| Navigation |     1.2–1.4 |
| Buttons    |     1.2–1.4 |
| Small Text |     1.4–1.5 |

