# 16. Freelance Website Functionality

The platform should incorporate familiar functionality found on established freelance marketplaces while maintaining its own identity.

### Client Workflow

**Post a Job → Receive Applications → Review Freelancers → Select Freelancer → Agree on Terms → Make Payment → Project Delivery → Review**

### Freelancer Workflow

**Create Profile → Add Skills → Add Portfolio → Browse Jobs → Apply → Get Hired → Complete Work → Receive Payment → Build Reputation**

This creates a clear two-sided marketplace between clients and freelancers.

